<!--
corona-gerboa-cartographer: the Council's Explorer of Places (avatar of the Corona).
A member of the Council as a giant jerboa explorer (scale 20 vpt, base anatomy with ears forward).
A warm desert-sand coat with golden shades and a delicate olive undertone.
It wears a rounded khaki/olive safari/colonial helmet with a pronounced front visor above the big eyes,
an emerald-green silk band (#7dd87d, the heraldic colour of the Cartographer), a pair of surveying lenses/goggles
raised on the front of the visor with green reflecting glasses and a glowing reflection, a green kerchief/scarf knotted at the neck,
and slung across its back a shiny brass telescope (#e4bb40) and a roll of parchment map tied with a green ribbon.
Box: 1.6 × 2.2 × 2.1 tiles, 32 × 44 × 42 voxels, 20 voxels per tile (vpt: 20).
Role: npc.
-->
